# =============================================================================
# exp14_vitlarge_adamw
# ViT-Large + UAM_Unified + AdamW + Cosine LR + CJ + RPT
# Changes from exp13:
#   1. AdamW optimizer, LR=2e-5
#   2. Cosine LR (t_initial=120, warmup 5 epochs, lr_min=0.02*BASE_LR)
#   3. Color Jitter ON
#   4. Random Patch ON (prob=0.5)
